OL,3,ACraig Charles' tribute to 'city that
OL,4,Ashaped me'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I was just reacting to what was going
OL,7,Fon," he said. "Reacting to the riots,
OL,8,Freacting to Thatcher, reacting to
OL,9,Fpolice harassment, reacting to poverty.
